{"schema_version":2,"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","events":[{"id":"zhouyu-e-o039a","title":"孙权独引鲁肃合榻密议","accounts":[{"id":"zhouyu-e-o039a-account","label":"《周瑜鲁肃吕蒙传》正文","text":"孙权独引鲁肃合榻密议","evidence":["zhouyu-e-o039a-q"]},{"id":"zhouyu-a-o040-judgment","label":null,"text":"鲁肃料汉室难复曹操难猝除，建议鼎足江东、图黄祖刘表及建号。","evidence":["zhouyu-q-o040-judgment"]},{"id":"zhouyu-a-o041-judgment","label":null,"text":"孙权答欲尽力一方以辅汉，称帝之言非所及。","evidence":["zhouyu-q-o041-judgment"]}],"participants":[{"person":"sun-quan","role":"问策","evidence":["zhouyu-e-o039a-q"]},{"person":"lu-su","role":"应对","evidence":["zhouyu-e-o039a-q"]}],"place":null,"time":{"label":"孙策卒后、孙权住吴时","precision":"relative","basis":"保留本条时间表达，不据相邻段落自动补年。","evidence":["zhouyu-e-o039a-q"]},"ordering_evidence":"zhouyu-e-o039a-q","source_order":[54,187,"O039a"],"order":9645}],"persons":[{"id":"lu-su","name":"鲁肃","facts":[],"aliases":[]},{"id":"sun-quan","name":"孙权","facts":[],"aliases":[]}],"evidence":[{"id":"zhouyu-e-o039a-q","section":"chapter-054","block":"b-c28b4f0860ac19d768d1","layer":"original","quote":"众宾罢退，肃亦辞出；乃独引肃还，合榻对饮。因密议曰：“今汉室倾危，四方云扰〖10〗；孤承父兄余业，思有桓、文之功〖11〗。君既惠顾，何以佐之？”","section_title":"周瑜鲁肃吕蒙传第九","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0115.xhtml","index":186,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":0,"end":72},{"id":"zhouyu-q-o040-judgment","section":"chapter-054","block":"b-946768480b126c05a892","layer":"original","quote":"肃对曰：“昔高帝区区，欲尊事义帝而不获者〖12〗，以项羽为害也〖13〗。今之曹操，犹昔项羽；将军何由得为桓、文乎？肃窃料之：汉室不可复兴，曹操不可猝除。为将军计，惟有鼎足江东〖14〗，以观天下之衅〖15〗。规模如此〖16〗，亦自无嫌〖17〗。何者？北方诚多务也〖18〗。因其多务，剿除黄祖，进伐刘表；竟长江所极，据而有之；然后建号帝王，以图天下：此高帝之业也。”","section_title":"周瑜鲁肃吕蒙传第九","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0115.xhtml","index":187,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":0,"end":181},{"id":"zhouyu-q-o041-judgment","section":"chapter-054","block":"b-e2265cdb880a2eed5084","layer":"original","quote":"权曰：“今尽力一方，冀以辅汉耳；此言，非所及也。”","section_title":"周瑜鲁肃吕蒙传第九","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0115.xhtml","index":188,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":0,"end":25}],"profiles":{},"directory_counts":{}}
